  "reference": "Mwanzo 32",
  "verseCount": 32,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "32",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 32"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "32",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo aliendelea na safari yake. Basi, malaika wa Mungu wakakutana naye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo alipowaona, akasema, “Hili ni jeshi la Mungu!” Kwa hiyo akapaita mahali hapo Mahanaimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32:2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mahanaimu:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Maana yake “vikosi viwili vya majeshi”.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo aliwatuma wajumbe wamtangulie kwenda kwa nduguye Esau, huko Seiri, katika nchi ya Edomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aliwapa maagizo haya, “Mtamwambia bwana wangu Esau hivi: Mtumishi wako Yakobo asema hivi, ‘Nimekaa ugenini kwa Labani mpaka sasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nina ng'ombe, punda, makundi ya kondoo na watumishi wa kiume na wa kike. Ninakutumia ujumbe huu, bwana wangu, ili nipate fadhili mbele yako.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hao wajumbe walikwenda, kisha wakarudi na kumwambia Yakobo, “Tumefika kwa ndugu yako Esau, naye yuko njiani kuja kukulaki, akiwa na watu 400.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Yakobo akaogopa sana na kufadhaika. Akawagawa katika makundi mawili watu waliokuwa pamoja naye, kondoo, mifugo mingine na ngamia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akifikiri, “Kama Esau akija na kuliangamiza kundi moja, basi, kundi litakalosalia litaponyoka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha Yakobo akamwomba Mungu akisema, “Ee Mungu wa babu yangu Abrahamu, Mungu wa baba yangu Isaka! Ewe Mwenyezi-Mungu uliyeniambia nirudi katika nchi yangu kwa jamaa yangu, ukaniahidi kunitendea mema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sistahili hata kidogo fadhili ulizonipa kwa uaminifu mimi mtumishi wako. Nilipovuka mto Yordani, sikuwa na kitu ila fimbo; lakini sasa ninayo makundi haya mawili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakuomba uniokoe sasa kutoka kwa ndugu yangu Esau, maana nina hofu kuwa atatushambulia na kutuua sote, akina mama pamoja na watoto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wewe uliniahidi kunitendea mema na kuwafanya wazawa wangu wawe wengi kama mchanga wa bahari ambao hauhesabiki kwa wingi wake.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Yakobo akalala hapo usiku huo. Kisha akatenga sehemu ya mali yake, iwe zawadi kwa ndugu yake Esau: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbuzi majike 200 na mabeberu 20, kondoo majike 200 na madume 20, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngamia 30 wanyonyeshao pamoja na ndama wao, ng'ombe majike 40 na mafahali kumi, na punda majike 20 na madume kumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akawakabidhi watumishi wake, kila mmoja kundi lake, akawaambia, “Nitangulieni mkiacha nafasi kati ya kundi na kundi katika msafara wenu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akamwagiza yule aliyetangulia, “Ndugu yangu Esau atakapokutana nawe na kukuuliza, ‘Wewe ni mtumishi wa nani? Unakwenda wapi? Na wanyama hawa ni wa nani?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wewe utamjibu, ‘Hii ni mali ya mtumishi wako Yakobo, nayo ni zawadi yako wewe bwana wangu Esau. Tena Yakobo mwenyewe yuko nyuma anafuata.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akatoa agizo hilohilo kwa mtumishi wa kundi la pili na la tatu na wengine wote, akisema, “Mtamwambia Esau maneno hayohayo mtakapokutana naye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zaidi ya yote, mtamwambia, ‘Mtumishi wako Yakobo yuko nyuma, anafuata.’” Yakobo alifanya hivyo akifikiri, “Pengine nitamtuliza kwa zawadi hizi ninazomtangulizia, na baadaye naweza kuonana naye ana kwa ana; huenda atanipokea.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, akatanguliza zawadi zake, lakini yeye mwenyewe akalala kambini usiku huo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Usiku huohuo Yakobo akaamka, akawachukua wake zake wawili, wajakazi wake wawili na watoto wake kumi na mmoja, akapita kivuko cha Yaboki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baada ya kuwavusha ngambo ya kijito wale waliokuwa nao na mali yake yote, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo alibaki peke yake. Mtu mmoja akaja, akapigana naye mwereka mpaka alfajiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mtu huyo alipoona kwamba hawezi kumshinda Yakobo, alimgusa Yakobo nyonga ya kiuno, naye akateguka alipokuwa anapigana naye mwereka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha yule mtu akamwambia Yakobo, “Niache niende zangu, kwani kunapambazuka.” Lakini Yakobo akamwambia, “Sikuachi kamwe, mpaka umenibariki!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye akamwuliza, “Jina lako nani?” Yeye akamjibu, “Yakobo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yule mtu akamwambia, “Hutaitwa Yakobo tena, bali Israeli,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32:28",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Israeli:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ni kama neno la Kiebrania lenye maana “apiganaye na” au “Mungu hupigana”.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kwa kuwa umeshindana na Mungu na wanadamu, ukashinda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.28"
