        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo Yakobo akamwambia, “Tafadhali, nakuomba uniambie jina lako.” Lakini yeye akamwambia, “Ya nini kuniuliza jina langu?” Kisha akambariki Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo akapaita mahali hapo Penueli,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32:30",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Penieli:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ni kama neno la Kiebrania lenye maana “uso wa Mungu”.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " akisema, “Nimemwona Mungu uso kwa uso, nami sikufa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jua lilikuwa limekwisha chomoza wakati Yakobo alipoondoka Penueli; akawa anachechemea kwa sababu ya kiuno chake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndiyo maana mpaka leo Waisraeli hawali msuli wa nyonga, kwa maana yule mtu alimgusa Yakobo panapo nyonga katika msuli wa kiuno chake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.32"
            ]
          }
